    <briefdescription>
<para>Adapter that wraps a caller-supplied <computeroutput>std::function</computeroutput> as a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_merge_resolver" kindref="compound">MergeResolver</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The provided callable receives <computeroutput>(local, remote)</computeroutput> and must return the merged snapshot. The caller is responsible for ensuring commutativity, idempotency, and thread-safety of the callable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
